@startuml storage_ownership
title Shared-Data FAT to Physical MSC Ownership
autonumber

participant "Main runtime" as Main
participant "Storage-owner state machine" as Owner
database "Shared Data FAT" as FAT
participant "USB MSC class" as MSC
actor "PC mass-storage host" as Host

Main -> Owner : MSC requested by assignment/composition
Owner --> Main : FAT_TO_MSC action
Main -> Main : stop filesystem-backed MCUmgr transport
Main -> FAT : unmount Shared Data FAT
alt unmount succeeds
  Main -> MSC : initialize and enable disk export
  MSC --> Main : started
  Main -> Owner : commit MSC ownership
  Host -> MSC : raw block I/O
else unmount or MSC startup fails
  Main -> FAT : restore FAT mount if needed
  Main -> Main : restore filesystem transport
end
note over Main, Host : FAT and MSC ownership must never overlap
Host --> MSC : disconnect / stop requested
MSC --> Main : shutdown
Main -> Main : controlled reboot before FAT remount if worker state is uncertain
@enduml
